          "rules": [
            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "enabled": true,
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Including user-supplied data in a SQL query to Postgres without neutralizing special elements can make code vulnerable to SQL Injection."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "# Uncontrolled data in SQL query to Postgres\nThe code passes user input as part of a SQL query without escaping special elements. It generates a SQL query to Postgres using `sprintf`, with the user-supplied data directly passed as an argument to `sprintf`. This leaves the code vulnerable to attack by SQL Injection.\n\n\n## Recommendation\nUse a library routine to escape characters in the user-supplied string before converting it to SQL. Use `esc` and `quote` pqxx library functions.\n\n\n## Example\n\n```cpp\n#include \u003ciostream\u003e\n#include \u003cstdexcept\u003e\n#include \u003cpqxx/pqxx\u003e\n\nint main(int argc, char ** argv) {\n\n    if (argc != 2) { \n        throw std::runtime_error(\"Give me a string!\");\n    }\n    \n    pqxx::connection c;\n    pqxx::work w(c);\n\n    // BAD\n    char *userName = argv[1];\n    char query1[1000] = {0};\n    sprintf(query1, \"SELECT UID FROM USERS where name = \\\"%s\\\"\", userName);\n    pqxx::row r = w.exec1(query1);\n    w.commit();\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c r[0].as\u003cint\u003e() \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n    // GOOD\n    pqxx::result r2 = w.exec(\"SELECT \" + w.quote(argv[1]));\n    w.commit();\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c r2[0][0].c_str() \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\n```\n\n## References\n* MSDN Library: [SQL Injection](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/sql/relational-databases/security/sql-injection).\n* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-89](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html).\n",
                "text": "# Uncontrolled data in SQL query to Postgres\nThe code passes user input as part of a SQL query without escaping special elements. It generates a SQL query to Postgres using `sprintf`, with the user-supplied data directly passed as an argument to `sprintf`. This leaves the code vulnerable to attack by SQL Injection.\n\n\n## Recommendation\nUse a library routine to escape characters in the user-supplied string before converting it to SQL. Use `esc` and `quote` pqxx library functions.\n\n\n## Example\n\n```cpp\n#include \u003ciostream\u003e\n#include \u003cstdexcept\u003e\n#include \u003cpqxx/pqxx\u003e\n\nint main(int argc, char ** argv) {\n\n    if (argc != 2) { \n        throw std::runtime_error(\"Give me a string!\");\n    }\n    \n    pqxx::connection c;\n    pqxx::work w(c);\n\n    // BAD\n    char *userName = argv[1];\n    char query1[1000] = {0};\n    sprintf(query1, \"SELECT UID FROM USERS where name = \\\"%s\\\"\", userName);\n    pqxx::row r = w.exec1(query1);\n    w.commit();\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c r[0].as\u003cint\u003e() \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n    // GOOD\n    pqxx::result r2 = w.exec(\"SELECT \" + w.quote(argv[1]));\n    w.commit();\n    std::cout \u003c\u003c r2[0][0].c_str() \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\n```\n\n## References\n* MSDN Library: [SQL Injection](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/sql/relational-databases/security/sql-injection).\n* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-89](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html).\n"
              },
              "id": "cpp/sql-injection-via-pqxx",
              "name": "cpp/sql-injection-via-pqxx",
              "properties": {
                "description": "Including user-supplied data in a SQL query to Postgres\n              without neutralizing special elements can make code\n              vulnerable to SQL Injection.",
                "id": "cpp/sql-injection-via-pqxx",
                "kind": "path-problem",
                "name": "Uncontrolled data in SQL query to Postgres",
                "precision": "high",
                "problem.severity": "error",
                "queryURI": "https://github.com/github/codeql/blob/b73a2f7d56a22eb2bd892f0c5c014e5b8f35bd7c/cpp/ql/src/experimental/Security/CWE/CWE-089/SqlPqxxTainted.ql",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-089"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled data in SQL query to Postgres"
              }
